Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:44:32 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] [M159] [lens] Only focus overlay WebView when tab is
 activated

Original change's description:
> [lens] Only focus overlay WebView when tab is activated
>
> In `OverlayBaseController::ShowOverlay()`, mirror the existing
> `tab_->IsActivated()` guard in `HideOverlay()` so `RequestFocus()` is
> only called when the overlay's tab is active.
>
> When a tab-scoped overlay (such as the Glic selection overlay in split
> view) is backgrounded and later reshown via `TabForegrounded()` while
> still inactive, unconditionally calling `overlay_web_view_->RequestFocus()`
> steals focus from the active tab and can synchronously trigger
> tab-activation callbacks during another tab's notification.
>
